    "text": "今天和明天受到大陸冷氣團南下",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 14.56,
    "duration": 4.200000000000001,
    "text": "幾乎受冷卻的影響",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 18.76,
    "duration": 5.599999999999998,
    "text": "各地的氣溫早晚都比較冷",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 24.36,
    "duration": 5.800000000000001,
    "text": "西半部地區的日夜溫差大",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 30.16,
    "duration": 6.4999999999999964,
    "text": "台灣各地即澎湖、金門、馬祖",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 36.66,
    "duration": 3.3000000000000043,
    "text": "大都為多雲到晴的天氣",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 39.96,
    "duration": 6.199999999999996,
    "text": "只有東部、東南部地區以及恆春半島",
